        </p>
        <p>
          In Bali, while premier coworking spaces like Tropical Nomad (Canggu) or Outpost (Ubud) feature redundant Starlink installations, standard guesthouses and villas suffer frequent latency spikes. Tropical storms, falling palm fronds, and ongoing road trenching along Raya Canggu lead to recurring local fiber breaks.
        </p>

