              <li><strong>Validity:</strong> 5 Years with multiple entries</li>
              <li><strong>Stay Period:</strong> 180 days per entry (extendable +180 days in-country)</li>
              <li><strong>Financial Requirement:</strong> 500,000 THB (~$14,000 USD) in liquid bank account</li>
              <li><strong>Fee:</strong> ~10,000 THB (~$280 USD)</li>
              <li><strong>Work Rights:</strong> Explicitly legal for digital nomads & offshore founders</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

