              <li><strong>Application Fee:</strong> ~$1,500 – $2,200 via immigration agents</li>
              <li><strong>Alternative:</strong> B211A Visit Visa (60-day blocks with recurring agent extensions)</li>
              <li><strong>Work Rights:</strong> Permitted strictly for foreign clients outside Indonesia</li>
            </ul>
